# Skill mirrors regenerated by `composer sync-ai` (package-boost:sync).
# Some entries are symlinks into vendor/, which would dangle on GitHub
# web (no vendor/) and in fresh clones before composer install.
# Source of truth: .ai/skills/ + vendor/<pkg>/resources/boost/skills/.
.github/skills/
.claude/skills/
.agents/skills/
